\ forth word evaluate
: evaluate
(source-str) dup 2@ >r >r 2 cells + @ >r
(source-str)
dup rot swap !
dup rot swap 2 cells + !
1 cells + 0 swap !
['] interpret catch ?dup if
    r> (source-str) dup rot swap 2 cells + !
    r> r> rot 2!
    throw
then
r> (source-str) dup rot swap 2 cells + !
r> r> rot 2! ;
